<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-FIVE NATIONS STATISTICS.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-FIVE NATIONS STATISTICS.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Jan 16 Reuter) - Facts and figures from past Five</p>
<p>Nations championships:</p>
<p>....</p>
<p>Last season's Five Nations table/statistics:</p>
<p>		     P  W  D  L   F  A  Pts</p>
<p>England	    4  3  0  1  79  54  6</p>
<p>Scotland	   4  3  0  1  60  56  6</p>
<p>France	     4  2  0  2  89  57  4</p>
<p>Wales		4  1  0  3  62  82  2</p>
