<p>Most Points in a Five Nations match:24   -  Sebastien Viars</p>
<p>(France) v Ireland 1992</p>
<p>-  Rob Andrew (England)  v Scotland  1995</p>
<p>Most Points in a Five Nations season:67   -  Jonathan Webb</p>
