<p>*****</p>
<p>Wales and England have won the title outright 22 times each.</p>
<p>Scotland have won it 13 times, Ireland 10 and France 10.</p>
<p>		 *****</p>
<p>Grand Slam winners:</p>
<p>England 11 (1913, 1914, 1921, 1923, 1924, 1928, 1957, 1980, 1991, 1992, 1995)</p>
<p>Wales 8 (1908, 1909, 1911, 1950, 1952, 1971, 1976, 1978)</p>
